<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices -March 20.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices -March 20.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    97/99    103/105     UNQ     203/207</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  100/103   106/109   200/205   210/220</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker suppliers raised their prices higher on Thursday amid recent cargo gains but talks were thin as most shipowners considered prices here too high and Japanese buyers were on holiday. The 180-cst grade was about $4-$5 per tonne higher in Singapore than in South Korea, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
